==Question #2==
{{Cquote2|With how frequent use of prossy armour is, are there any plans to add another tier or perhaps to continue the Slug Menace storyline?}}

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H25pJMUl1_w&t=393s Youtube Time Stamp]

